/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  TWO TEARS, `brine` (the pressure exchanger's high-pressure inlet) and `rec`
  (the second pass's concentrate, back to the first pass's feed).  Wegstein
  with its full secant step, as membrane27: the exchanger loop's gain is
  1 - leakage, so a Newton step on it overshoots (see that case's solverDict).
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

recycleSolver          Wegstein;
recycleWegsteinQmin    -5;
recycleWegsteinQmax    0;
recycleMaxIter         800;
recycleTol             1.0e-5;
